{"id":"000VPO","title":"The Infiltration of Alamut Castle","author":"sfushidahardy","solvedCount":2,"difficulty":4,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-10-29T05:55:55+00:00","posted":"Heute, 03:22 Uhr","rules":"The Infiltration of Alamut Castle\n\nThis puzzle was made for a weekly Scojo setting prompt, in which we were tasked with setting a puzzle involving a battenberg Sudoku constraint. I took this opportunity to instead set a Sudoku hybrid with the pencil-puzzle genre Battenberg painting. I hope you enjoy it!\n\nRules:\n\n• Sudoku: place digits 1~9 once each in every row, column, and 3x3 box. Two (ciphered) Sudoku digits are given.\n\n• Battenberg: shade some cells in the grid. Every battenberg clue indicates that the shading forms a 2x2 checkerboard-pattern around the clue. All battenberg clues are given.\n\n• Outside clues: numbers around the grid indicate the sum of all digits in shaded cells in the corresponding row or column.\n\n• (Non-standard) cipher: each letter C,R,...,S is assigned a distinct non-zero digit, to be determined. A \"?\" can always represent any digit, including 0. (In other words, \"?A\" could be the single digit number \"A\".)\n\nSolving links: (Mobile) Penpa, Sudokupad. (Wide-screen) Penpa, Sudokupad\n\nPenpa+ (Practice)\n\nA practice puzzle to clarify the rules if needed.\n\nPenpa+\nSudokupad\n\nIf you prefer, the following solving links are mobile friendly: Penpa, Sudokupad.","solutionCode":"Unshaded digits in row 2","tags":["Sudoku","Battenburg (Variante)"],"links":[{"url":"https://tinyurl.com/alamut-penpa","kind":"short"},{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/c9vm7r2j2g","kind":"sudokupad"},{"url":"https://tinyurl.com/alamut-solve","kind":"short"},{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/0xqxetokva","kind":"sudokupad"},{"url":"https://tinyurl.com/alamut-eg","kind":"short"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/c9vm7r2j2g","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":12,"cols":10,"cages":0,"hasSolution